d his secretary didn't likehim, either, becuase he was so clumsy and he made a lot of mistakes.--不論什麼時候秉持一個觀念: 做別人的事, 學自己的功\夫              聽別人的課, 學自己的心得忙茫盲？現代人的文明病，也許\就像我一樣，‧‧        加油吧～！",]),(["title":"●BAKCUP","time":1000623291,"msg":"[0;1;36m [1m [1m [1m [1mT[1mA[1mB[1mL[1mE[1m [1mA[1m-[1m5[1m [1mF[1mi[1mr[1ms[1mt[1m [1mS[1mt[1ma[1mg[1me[1m [1mo[1mf[1m [1mQ[1mu[1mi[1mn[1me[1m-[1mM[1mc[1mK[1ml[1mu[1ms[1mk[1me[1my[1m [1mM[1me[1mt[1mh[1mo[1md[1m [1mf[1mo[1mr[1m [1mF[1m [1m=[1m [1m~[0m[0;1;36m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[0m[0;1;36mP[1mr[1mo[1md[1mu[1mc[1mt[1m [1mT[1me[1mr[1mm[1m [1m [1m [1m [1mI[1mn[1md[1me[1mx[1m [1m [1m [1mA[1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1mB[1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1mC[1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1mD[0m[0;1;36m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[0m[0;1;4mA[0;1m*[0;1;4mB[0;1m*[0;1;4mC[0;1m*[1mD[1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m1[1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m0[1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m0[1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m0[1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m [1m1[0m[0;1;36m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m-[1m